{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cDid you do it? Did you reach Him?\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A souls-like deckbuilder in first-person 3D where each run is a new life told by a mysterious innkeeper. A replayable mystical experience with tactical combat in a world that remembers your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the Road, Errant, only then we will know if you became Legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/68af845bebbea4631f6840bd83d0535e.poster.avif?t=1755106041\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/68af845bebbea4631f6840bd83d0535e.webm?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/68af845bebbea4631f6840bd83d0535e.mp4?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Souls Like Deckbuilder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A never-before-seen genre blend. Customizable decks along brutal combat, a cryptic narrative, and larger-than-life enemies. The world was destroyed by someone\u2019s terrible decisions; thus, we must play the Game of Cards to remember our fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/c1852f21ed6f49645365e7209a261ee5.poster.avif?t=1755106041\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/c1852f21ed6f49645365e7209a261ee5.webm?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/c1852f21ed6f49645365e7209a261ee5.mp4?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World Remembers your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live and die with the consequences of your choices. Unlock classes, items, and cards. Encounter new NPCs, unlock new paths, discover the story of the tavern, the realm, and the mysterious innkeeper. Experience the life and legacy of an Errant through the Game, a moment flashing before your eyes right before their final rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each Turn is a Puzzle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use each card to attack, to defend, as a resource, or discard it to activate a special ability. Even enemies are dealt cards that represent their intentions. Be creative, sequence, and defeat your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/607a713e7dea7ebf9da48cb8a5999769.poster.avif?t=1755106041\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/607a713e7dea7ebf9da48cb8a5999769.webm?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/607a713e7dea7ebf9da48cb8a5999769.mp4?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In its ideal version, the Tavern\u2019s world and the Game of Cards contains hundreds of cards and keepsakes, a world that remembers the choices you\u2019ve made and several life-defying bosses in the form of corrupted heroes and mythical creatures. If you wish to join this dream, wishlist us, get the demo, and venture into the Road through a Game of Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/36be2f639aa05af4414c3abf845196ee.poster.avif?t=1755106041\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/36be2f639aa05af4414c3abf845196ee.webm?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/extras/36be2f639aa05af4414c3abf845196ee.mp4?t=1755106041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933280?t=1755106041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933280?t=1755106041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/a24c0f544ec1cc12ed29b072678e64d7c21a385d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755106041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933280/a24c0f544ec1cc12ed29b072678e64d7c21a385d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755106041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cDid you do it? Did you reach Him?\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A souls-like deckbuilder in first-person 3D where each run is a new life told by a mysterious innkeeper. A replayable mystical experience with tactical combat in a world that remembers your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the Road, Errant, only then we will know if you became Legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi